{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>據《WIRED》記者 Julian Chokkattu 報道，Apple 計劃在今年稍後推出的軟件更新中，為 iPhone Duo 加入 Reachability 功能。文章推測該功能會在內螢幕與外螢幕同時提供，但未有明確說明。</p><h3>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定</h3><p>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定，目前已見於其他 iPhone 型號。用戶在螢幕底部邊緣向下滑動，介面上半部便會下移，令畫面上的控制項更容易以單手觸及。至於今年稍後更新的具體日期，以及在內、外螢幕上的實際運作方式，報道未提供進一步細節。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8680fb86560919b06053d75219b016ec687f91a42a9ec44ec714d2493fdefaee/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F5631c047088dc4afe69247e00b2711fe\"/><p>消息來源</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:22:23.804720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:52:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:17:59.271408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:48.366531+00:00","content_hash":"09c626f22f10ababf62e16a577834b61e9214191fffd721bb90aa30898f4023b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}